[{"title":"次韵探梅二绝 其二","author":"郭印","text":"祇从地底一阳来，已把东皇次第催。\n烟缕未看原上柳，霜苞先探岭头梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60716,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵探梅二绝 其一","author":"郭印","text":"淡妆曾记出疏篱，岁晚南枝的皪稀。\n后夜月明如破萼，暗香还是著人衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60717,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾端伯早春即事五首 其五","author":"郭印","text":"使君千骑出重城，对镜心闲似水清。\n岂但邦人安善政，波间鸥鸟亦无惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60718,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾端伯早春即事五首 其四","author":"郭印","text":"九畹春回未放兰，先饶堤柳变衰残。\n阴阳代谢寻常尔，正好随流著眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60719,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾端伯早春即事五首 其三","author":"郭印","text":"一声幽鸟解呼春，物逐新年气象新。\n坐阅群生空扰扰，身如槁木是何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60720,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾端伯早春即事五首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"士女梅花插满头，一川人日恣嬉游。\n贤侯可是知民意，特地江干驻碧油。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60721,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵曾端伯早春即事五首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"春风著物便超摇，已觉三阴次第消。\n明日江梅吹尽雪，却看芳草似裙腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60722,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池莲","author":"郭印","text":"擢干洿池中，天姿本清净。\n白白与红红，邂逅识真性。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60723,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池萍","author":"郭印","text":"杨花撩乱几时休，看取明朝水上浮。\n凝绿满池浑不动，微波忽绽见鱼游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60724,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芝产之五日有双莲生于东池亟往视之出水已二尺许园人云亦旦日所抽茎也复作三诗纪焉 其二","author":"郭印","text":"七层芝草煌煌秀，一本荷花两两芳。\n无象太平人不识，天教卉木效珍祥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60725,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芝产之五日有双莲生于东池亟往视之出水已二尺许园人云亦旦日所抽茎也复作三诗纪焉 其三","author":"郭印","text":"岐麦嘉禾兆庆符，同茎合干复芙蕖。\n铺张伟绩吾曹事，苦恨无才可屡书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60726,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芝产之五日有双莲生于东池亟往视之出水已二尺许园人云亦旦日所抽茎也复作三诗纪焉 其一","author":"郭印","text":"红幢翠盖插方池，中有骈花并一枝。\n圣泽汪洋招瑞应，小臣蝼蚁岂能私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60727,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问汉守刘宝贤觅酒四首 其四","author":"郭印","text":"虽无斗量敌山涛，时复中之兴自高。\n醉里醒醒方解饮，勿将佳趣语儿曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60728,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问汉守刘宝贤觅酒四首 其三","author":"郭印","text":"村沽无复见瑶浆，苦涩酸辛巳备尝。\n欲洗野人藜苋腹，除非金雁送鹅黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60729,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问汉守刘宝贤觅酒四首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"不到房湖已数年，曲生风味想依然。\n使君酝籍真无敌，欲向樽中识圣贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60730,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问汉守刘宝贤觅酒四首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"酒几于道少人知，乘坠俱忘即我师。\n身后虚名如胜此，陶潜李白更无诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60731,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张都统怀古四首 其四","author":"郭印","text":"世浊求清笑屈平，时清把钓诧严陵。\n行藏有道君应解，独倚危楼高处层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60732,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张都统怀古四首 其三","author":"郭印","text":"人言诸葛事功难，八阵堂堂指顾间。\n认得君臣鱼有水，个中蛇势似常山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60733,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张都统怀古四首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"控弦谁敢与争锋，细柳将军眼自空。\n拊髀何须长叹息，分明颇牧在云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60734,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张都统怀古四首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"慇勤圯上一编书，汉四百年归卷舒。\n晚节莫教闲辟谷，皇王事业岂难如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60735,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"时升见惠芍药三朵作诗谢之二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"百花零落已成尘，闻道君家解系春。\n艳质娇娆应见惯，肯分粲者遗愁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60736,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"时升见惠芍药三朵作诗谢之二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"婢妾纷纷只谩争，美人后出更倾城。\n东君可是多情思，留取妖容作饯行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60737,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和计敏夫留题云溪","author":"郭印","text":"知君绝学谢尘编，语默行藏不碍禅。\n亲到云溪重说偈，天开地辟见纯全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60738,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和冯当可","author":"郭印","text":"相逢不作少年看，老著衣冠各强颜。\n明日龟陵分手后，音书又隔几重山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60739,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和光亭二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"川原万草木，总放无量光。\n要识和同意，乾坤不閟藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60740,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和光亭二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"有爱即耽著，竹色共花光。\n何似无心人，尧桀两相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和杜安行南湖泛筏诗","author":"郭印","text":"翩翩小筏隐如船，十亩平湖碧浸天。\n不待乞身追贺监，君今已是吏中仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和庞次甫秋日海棠二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"悬知草木太钟情，秋晚花梢照眼明。\n我已无心齐槁木，莫将妖态见春荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和庞次甫秋日海棠二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"谁将暖律入寒荄，红染枯枝特地开。\n可是仙人颜不老，霜朝唤得脸朱回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和厚卿雨凉午睡二首 其二","author":"郭印","text":"疾风吹雨打窗时，客睡昏昏半下帷。\n快意平生浑一榻，是中真乐几人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和厚卿雨凉午睡二首 其一","author":"郭印","text":"一番骤雨洗骄阳，秋色先贻枕簟凉。\n正作故山归梦好，觉来幽恨独何长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招任孝叔蒲明之江亭对月","author":"郭印","text":"高亭对月影成双，客舍何人共酒缸。\n今夕相邀同一醉，坐看金饼落澄江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦热和袁应祥用韦苏州乔木生夏凉流云吐华月为题十小诗 其一","author":"郭印","text":"旱魃难除遣，南箕未可招。\n安能飏双舄，飞去学王乔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦热和袁应祥用韦苏州乔木生夏凉流云吐华月为题十小诗 其九","author":"郭印","text":"呼吸一寒暑，三界本无家。\n人间自火宅，未老发先华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦热和袁应祥用韦苏州乔木生夏凉流云吐华月为题十小诗 其六","author":"郭印","text":"酷热无从避，天风几日秋。\n寸阴不知惜，大火急西流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦热和袁应祥用韦苏州乔木生夏凉流云吐华月为题十小诗 其八","author":"郭印","text":"中扃自清凉，穿凿多门户。\n神凝一气归，陋哉勤纳吐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦热和袁应祥用韦苏州乔木生夏凉流云吐华月为题十小诗 其五","author":"郭印","text":"倚杖长松底，无风昼自凉。\n吾庐傍林壑，嘉木耸千章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commi